# Future MCP Bot Setup

- MCP server built and connected to Claude, scoped exclusively to the cleaned and compiled dataset
  - Differs from prompt-level grounding: grounding embeds context directly in the prompt/code; MCP is external, called at query time, and returns filtered values from the server side
  - Practical effect: Claude cannot reach the open internet; all answers are drawn only from the provided data
  - Can apply filters dynamically (e.g. isolate Alberta suicide rates from the full dataframe) and generate visuals from those filtered results

